    "rule": "Candidate enters tier T iff (Metal TG ngl=99 on rep_device[T] >= tier_floors_metal_tg[T]) AND (peak_load_mem fits ram_band[T] with iOS jetsam margin). Within a tier, candidates are ORDERED — first per model is the primary recommendation.",
