    "flagship_split_note": "Flagship is bifurcated: A-Pro iPhones ≈ 12-15 TG vs M-series 22-29 TG on 3-4B Q4_K_M. Floor is checked on flagship_A (conservative); numbers that only clear on M-series are listed but flagged as 'iPad/Mac usable'.",
